  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Rising long-term yields increase the cost of capital and raise discount rates, disproportionately hurting smaller entrants and startups while advantaging large incumbents with stronger balance sheets and access to liquidity, thus increasing concentration in AI hardware and supplier markets.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">treasury_bond_market_tug</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_tech_competitio</data>
