  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Aggressive central‑bank asset purchases and liquidity operations reduce funding stress and FX volatility for correspondent banks and trade finance providers, making them less likely to cut off or de‑risk business and thereby sustaining third‑party compliance with restrictions.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">treasury_bond_market_tug</data>
  <data key="d39">iran_economic_and_hormuz</data>
