  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Active market interventions (swap lines, asset purchases, liquidity facilities) stabilize payment and FX channels and free short‑term cash positions for suppliers and recipient governments, enabling immediate acceleration of payments and military shipments.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">treasury_bond_market_tug</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
