  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Sustained allied weapons and logistics flows create explicit demand for secure, onshore dual‑use supply chains, inducing private and public capital commitments into domestic AI hardware fabs, packaging and related infrastructure.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_tech_competitio</data>
</edge>
