  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.85</data>
  <data key="d36">Rising perceptions of imminent escalation prompt central banks and treasuries to deploy preemptive bond purchases, liquidity facilities and swap lines to calm funding strains and tail-risk concerns.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
