  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.75</data>
  <data key="d36">Rising perception that the conflict may broaden increases domestic political pressure in both countries to take hardline economic positions (use trade tools for leverage, restrict sensitive transfers), intensifying confrontational rhetoric and demands for retaliatory trade measures in bilateral disputes.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d39">us_canada_trade_spat</data>
