  <data key="d35">0.8</data>
  <data key="d36">Rising perceptions that the Russia–Ukraine conflict may broaden prompt US/EU policymakers to expand and more actively enforce export controls and sanctions on advanced computing and semiconductors destined for China to limit dual‑use spillovers.</data>
