  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Sustained inflows of capital into non‑Western chip/hardware production and alternative finance in China and allied markets create viable suppliers and payment channels that third parties can use to evade Western restrictions, reducing overall compliance with sanctions on Iran.</data>
