  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.65</data>
  <data key="d36">An increase in global AI accelerator and vision-processor manufacturing capacity lowers unit costs and expands availability of components used in loitering munitions, comms/autonomy kits and seekers, enabling faster fielding or replenishment of UAV/precision strike stocks and thus raising the tempo of kinetic strikes.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
